This project develops privacy-first navigation and anti-spoofing tools for research and defensive development.

Permitted use
- Privacy-preserving navigation, testing and evaluation with explicit authorization, and research to detect or mitigate location spoofing.

Prohibited use
- Stalking, harassment, unauthorized tracking, bypassing security, impersonation, fraud, or any unlawful activity.

Legal & ethics
- Comply with local laws and third-party terms. Obtain written permission before testing on devices, networks, or services you do not own.

Security
- Report vulnerabilities privately to the maintainers for responsible disclosure.

Disclaimer
- Maintainers provide this software for defensive research only and are not liable for misuse. Use responsibly and ethically.
